  "predicted_behavior": "From cold 0.2: initial u~0.53-0.59, rise with ~150-200s to band, enter band ~150-220s, settle within +/-0.025 by <300s. Small overshoot <0.015 above 0.5 due to lag, then converge. Steady u ~0.30-0.34 centered 0.322, MAE after 300s <0.012, in-band >90%, energy ~0.10 per s (u^2~0.10). From near band: settle <120s with no overshoot beyond 0.55. Never exceeds 0.70 in normal tracking.",
