 "diagnosis_category": "response_slower",
 "machine_card": "Adaptive FF + filtered PID-D on measurement for first-order heater (tau ~150-250s, dead-time ~20-60s, K~1.4 y/u). Nominal ff 0.322 for target 0.5, auto-trims to 0.05-0.75. Kp 0.5, Ki 0.028, Kd 4.0. Operates y in [0,1], target ~0.5, dt 0.2-5s, noisy y. Output 0-0.80 (hard 0-1), safety cut to 0.20 above 0.70 and 0 above 0.80. For cold starts, limits initial drive to ~0.55-0.60 to prevent overshoot while still entering band by ~130s nominal / ~210s slowed.",
